    ],
    whatYoudNeed: 'Any graduate degree works, though communications, law or public policy backgrounds are advantageous. GRI Certified Sustainability Professional or Certificate in ESG (CFA Institute) are increasingly relevant given the growth of ESG requirements. A CV should showcase the ability to navigate complex bureaucracies, build consensus, and communicate under pressure.',
  ),
  CareerHandbookEntry(
