    careerRoadmap: 'Officers typically start running the tactical technology floor — helpdesk, network uptime, patching, basic access controls, or monitoring firewall logs and low-level alerts. The role grows to managing more complex architectures, disaster-recovery planning and cloud migration, then to leading infrastructure or security strategy for a division, including incident-response planning and budget ownership. At the senior tiers, the officer sets enterprise-wide technology posture, culminating in board-level accountability for the organisation\'s overall digital risk.',
    whoSucceeds: [
